# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .NET / ASP.NET Core
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
out/

## NuGet packages
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/
packages/
# Restore lock file IS committed intentionally; remove this if you don't want it:
# packages.lock.json

## Publish output
[Pp]ublish/
PublishProfiles/

## .NET tools
.dotnet/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS & SENSITIVE DATA  ← primary reason for this file
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## Never commit files that contain real API keys or connection strings.
## Use .NET User Secrets (dotnet user-secrets) or environment variables instead.
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Staging.json
appsettings.local.json
appsettings.*.local.json

## .NET User Secrets storage (managed by the SDK, outside the project dir)
## These live in %APPDATA%\Microsoft\UserSecrets\ — already outside repo.
secrets.json

## Environment files sometimes used with Docker / docker-compose
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

## Azure / AWS / GCP credential files that may end up in the project
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
servicePrincipal.json
local.settings.json          # Azure Functions local settings

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.rsuser

## Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## VS Code (keep shared workspace settings, ignore personal overrides)
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Test results & coverage
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.trx

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
